(vector (map (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "net-kotobase's web.search/web.ingest/geo.search/geo.ingest tenant NSIDs\n    and their compile-onto-datomic.* design (no new pod API/index/auth)" "The well-known per-tenant graphs webpages/places and their\n    :webpage/*/:place/* schemas in kotobase.schema")), (:adr/supersedes (vector)), (:adr/superseded_by (vector)), (:adr/topic "net-kotobase-web-geo-datalog-search"), (:adr/related (vector "90-docs/adr/2607072200-kotoba-git-kotoba-rad-content-addressed-vcs.edn" "orgs/gftdcojp/net-kotobase docs/adr/2607072330-web-geo-datalog-search.edn (in-repo detail ADR)" "orgs/gftdcojp/net-kotobase docs/adr/2606201700-tenant-datom-write-plane.edn (the reused write gate)")), (:adr/status "accepted"), (:adr/id "adr-2607072430-net-kotobase-web-geo-datalog-search"), (:adr/doc_type "adr"), (:adr/last_verified "2026-07-07"), (:adr/body "# ADR-2607072430: net-kotobase web.*/geo.* — webpage + maps search compiled onto the datomic.* plane\n\n**Status**: accepted\n**Date**: 2026-07-07\n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki\n**Repo**: gftdcojp/net-kotobase (landed on main `67b8f6d8058e`; detailed ADR lives in-repo as `docs/adr/2607072330-web-geo-datalog-search.edn`)\n\n## Context\n\nkotobase.net (net-kotobase edge Worker) had three query families —\ndatomic.\\* (Datalog), graph.\\* (SPARQL/quads), kg.\\* (ontology-shaped hybrid\nsearch) — but no content-type surfaces: webpage search and maps/place search\ndid not exist (確認 2026-07-07: maps/webpage 相当の surface はゼロ)。オーナー\n指示: 「では設計実装してください. maps, search なども datomic 系をベースに.」\n\n## Decision\n\nAdd four tenant NSIDs to net-kotobase that are pure *compilers onto the\nexisting datomic.\\* plane* — no new pod API, no new index/storage, no new\nauth model:\n\n- `web.ingest` / `geo.ingest` → caller-supplied webpage text / places become\n  `:webpage/*` / `:place/*` datoms via the **same tenant-cap\n  datomic.transact CACAO gate** (graph bound to `kotobase/db/<did>/<db_name>`,\n  defaults `webpages` / `places`; the edge does not crawl — no SSRF surface).\n- `web.search` / `geo.search` → one `:limit 1000`-capped map-form `datomic.q`\n  Datalog candidate scan + edge-side ranking (web: ASCII+CJK-bigram tokens,\n  coverage-dominant deterministic score, snippets — Japanese works without a\n  segmenter; geo: bbox containment or haversine radius with `distance_m`).\n- `webpages` / `places` join the Clojure-owned well-known schema authority\n  (`kotobase.schema`, `:webpage/url` / `:place/id` unique-identity);\n  `datomic.listDatabases` now advertises four well-known graphs.\n- Generated Datalog is data-patterns-only: kotoba-datomic predicate/fulltext\n  clause support is unverified, so push-down is a documented follow-up lift\n  (lexicons/response shapes won't change; `candidates` field makes the\n  1000-row recall cap observable).\n\nPure cores `kotobase.web` / `kotobase.geo` / `kotobase.rows` (clj/cljs/nbb\nportable, tested); route glue `kotobase.domain-search` (cljs, mirrors\n`kotobase.datomic` style); lexicons `contracts/lexicons/ai/gftd/apps/\nkotobase/{web,geo}/{ingest,search}.json`; worker bundle rebuilt and\nboundary-tested against the built artifact (8/8).\n\n## Superproject reflection\n\n- west pin advance: `net-kotobase` `ad0397dcf24d` → `67b8f6d8058e`\n  (GitHub API single-entry commit on manifest/west.yml, server-side merge —\n  no local shallow merge, no rebase, no force-push).\n\n## Findings (out of scope, reported)\n\n- The shared checkout `orgs/gftdcojp/net-kotobase` is stale AND carries ~4\n  unpushed local commits on `main` (`475fa6a` tip, not on GitHub — landing\n  page / deps work). Not touched; needs reconcile via the cleanup runbook.\n- Pre-existing on net-kotobase main (fail identically on pristine main,\n  unrelated to this change): `worker/test/explore_test.cljc`,\n  `worker/test/pin_test.cljc`, the full `nbb scripts/test.cljc` runner\n  invariant (reads `worker/package.json`, absent from the repo), and\n  `scripts/check-metadata.cljc` (kotoba submodule paths)."), (:adr/findings-out-of-scope (vector "Shared checkout orgs/gftdcojp/net-kotobase is stale and carries ~4 unpushed\n   local commits on main (tip 475fa6a, absent from GitHub) -- left untouched,\n   needs the git-cleanup-conflict runbook." "Pre-existing on net-kotobase main, unrelated to this change:\n   worker/test/explore_test.cljc and pin_test.cljc fail on pristine main;\n   nbb scripts/test.cljc full-runner invariant reads worker/package.json which\n   is absent from the repo; scripts/check-metadata.cljc fails on kotoba\n   submodule paths in a shallow non-submodule clone.")), (:adr/decision "{:nsids {:web.ingest \"caller-extracted {url,title,text,lang} -> :webpage/* datoms via the tenant-cap datomic.transact CACAO gate (graph kotobase/db/<did>/<db_name>, default webpages). Edge does not crawl (no SSRF).\", :web.search \"one :limit-1000-capped map-form datomic.q scan + edge ranking: ASCII + CJK-bigram tokens (Japanese without a segmenter), coverage-dominant deterministic score (title x3, capped tf), snippets.\", :geo.ingest \"{name,lat,lon,id?,tags?} -> :place/* datoms, same gate, default graph places; id slugged deterministically from name when absent.\", :geo.search \"same capped datomic.q scan + edge-side bbox containment or haversine radius (distance_m ranking); exactly one of bbox|near required.\"}, :invariants [\"No new pod surface, storage, or auth model -- everything compiles onto the existing datomic.* plane\" \"Ingest reuses proxy/authorize-tenant-cap-write unchanged (client graph CID cannot override ownership)\" \"Generated Datalog is data-patterns-only; pod predicate/fulltext push-down is a follow-up lift (kotoba-datomic support unverified); the candidates response field makes the 1000-row recall cap observable\" \"Clojure stays schema authority: webpages/places join kotobase.schema well-known; :webpage/url and :place/id are :db.unique/identity; datomic.listDatabases advertises 4 graphs\"], :artifacts [\"clj-edge/src/kotobase/{web,geo,rows,domain_search}.cljc (pure cores + cljs route glue)\" \"contracts/lexicons/ai/gftd/apps/kotobase/{web,geo}/{ingest,search}.json\" \"worker/test/web_geo_search_test.cljc (against the rebuilt committed bundle, 8/8)\" \"docs/adr/2607072330-web-geo-datalog-search.edn (in-repo detail)\"]}"), (:db/id -1), (:adr/landing "{:repo \"gftdcojp/net-kotobase\", :branch \"feat/web-geo-datalog-search\", :merge_sha \"67b8f6d8058e3b2fd8fa3f394e949d0b443a1ffa\", :merge_path \"gh api repos/gftdcojp/net-kotobase/merges (server-side, no local merge/rebase/force-push)\", :west_pin {:entry \"net-kotobase\", :from \"ad0397dcf24d3b5e084e944ffe4d726ae2002990\", :to \"67b8f6d8058e3b2fd8fa3f394e949d0b443a1ffa\", :path \"GitHub API single-entry commit on manifest/west.yml\"}}"), (:adr/problem "{:source \"オーナー指示 2026-07-07: 「では設計実装してください. maps, search なども datomic 系をベースに.」\", :facts [\"net-kotobase had datomic.*/graph.*/kg.* query families but zero\\n    webpage-search or maps surface (verified 2026-07-07 against lexicons,\\n    worker routes, and docs).\" \"kg.search is ontology/entity-shaped (OWL classes, embeddings), not a\\n    page or place surface.\"]}"), (:adr/authoritative true), (:adr/title "ADR-2607072430: net-kotobase web.*/geo.* -- webpage + maps search compiled onto the datomic.* plane"), (:adr/source-format "edn")))